OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies turn to food charity to
OL,4,Aput meals on the table
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach week, a charity in Bradford serves
OL,7,Fbiryani to people in need of a hot meal
OL,8,F- but they don't just get food, they
OL,9,Falso get a sense of community and
OL,10,Fcompanionship.
OL,12,FIn the past six months, the number of
OL,13,Fpeople coming to InTouch Foundation has
OL,14,Fincreased by 30%, and the charity now
OL,15,Fregularly feeds about 80-100 people
OL,16,Feach Tuesday evening.
OL,18,F"As you walk through that door you're
OL,19,Fpart of the family," says Osman Gondal,
OL,20,Fwho set up the charity in 2013.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
